---
source: lib/app/frontend/web/src/views.rs
expression: render_no_match_explorer(Some(&view)).into_string()
---
<section class="bg-white shadow-sm rounded-xl p-6 space-y-4" id="no-match-explorer"><div class="flex items-center justify-between"><h2 class="text-xl font-semibold">NoMatch explorer</h2><span class="text-sm text-slate-500">Codes that need NCIt follow-up (MappingState::NoMatch)</span></div><div class="overflow-x-auto"><table class="min-w-full divide-y divide-slate-200"><thead class="bg-slate-50"><tr><th class="px-4 py-2 text-left text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-slate-600">ServiceRequest</th><th class="px-4 py-2 text-left text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-slate-600">Code</th><th class="px-4 py-2 text-left text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-slate-600">Reason</th></tr></thead><tbody class="divide-y divide-slate-100 bg-white"><tr><td class="px-4 py-3 align-top"><p class="font-medium">SR-2</p><p class="text-sm text-slate-500">http://loinc.org</p></td><td class="px-4 py-3 align-top"><p class="font-semibold">99999-9</p><p class="text-sm text-slate-500">Unknown code</p></td><td class="px-4 py-3 align-top"><span class="inline-flex rounded-full bg-rose-100 px-2.5 py-1 text-xs font-semibold text-rose-900">missing_system_or_code</span></td></tr></tbody></table></div></section>
